@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Linux composition root\nmain, clock, I/O and bounded worker" as Root #F1F5F9
rectangle "Concrete adapters\nNDJSON decoder | inference backend | atomic JSON writer" as Adapters #E6F0FA
rectangle "Application\nPresenceMonitor + plain job/outcome contracts\nOwns the inference callable contract" as Application #DCEAF6
rectangle "Domain\nPlain values + pure evidence, time and state rules" as Domain #E2F3E9
Root --> Adapters : wires and owns
Root --> Application : calls with explicit values
Adapters --> Application : uses / implements inner contracts
Application --> Domain : applies rules
note right of Domain
No Linux, JSON, threads,
backend handles or I/O.
end note
legend bottom
Source dependencies point inward.
Runtime data flow is a separate view.
endlegend
@enduml
